A premium vintage fashion poster displayed as a finished editorial design artwork. Featuring an elegant Chinese young woman, half body portrait, beautiful facial features, wearing a lightweight, breathable silk dress with a dusty pink floral pattern. The fabric drapes gracefully, accentuating her figure. The color palette features dusty pink, deep teal, and navy blue, with subtle brass and golden accents. Cream white typography provides strong contrast against the background. Cinematic, ultra-realistic, bright soft studio lighting, high-end editorial aesthetic. A subtle large brass metallic ring and abstract watercolor brushstrokes in deep teal and dusty pink sit in the background. A faint vintage film grain texture covers the entire poster, with tiny floating golden dust particles. Display the title typography: "MOSS-Image" as the largest dominant headline, with "COMFYUI · SPATIAL LAYOUT" as a smaller subhead, and "图片布局控制" as a refined tagline. In the foreground, translucent deep teal botanical leaves with small red floral details add depth to the composition.

A premium vintage fashion poster displayed as a finished editorial design artwork. Featuring an elegant Chinese young woman on the right side, half body portrait, beautiful facial features, wearing a lightweight, breathable silk dress with a dusty pink floral pattern. The fabric drapes gracefully, accentuating her figure. The color palette features a dusty pink, deep teal, and navy blue background, with subtle brass and golden accents. Cream white typography provides strong contrast against the background. Cinematic, ultra-realistic, bright soft studio lighting, high-end editorial aesthetic. In the left background behind the text, there is a subtle, large brass metallic ring and abstract watercolor brushstrokes in deep teal and dusty pink. A faint vintage film grain texture covers the entire poster, with tiny floating golden dust particles. On the left side, prominently display the title typography: "MOSS-Image" as the largest dominant headline, with "COMFYUI · SPATIAL LAYOUT" placed above or beside it as a smaller subhead/brand label, and "图片布局控制" as a refined tagline beneath. Leave elegant negative space around the text for a clean editorial layout. In the foreground at the bottom edge, translucent deep teal botanical leaves with small red floral details slightly overlap the character, adding a sense of depth to the composition.

{"summary":{"caption":"一张高级的复古时尚海报，呈现为完成的编辑设计艺术作品。电影级光影，超写实，明亮柔和的工作室布光，高端编辑美学。整个海报覆盖着一层淡淡的复古胶片颗粒质感，漂浮着细小的金色微尘。整体色调以灰粉色、深青色和海军蓝为背景，点缀着微妙的黄铜色与金色。"},"items":[{"label":"object","caption":"画面左侧背景中，有一个微弱的巨大黄铜金属圆环，以及深青色与灰粉色交织的抽象水彩笔触。","bbox":[-450,-450,100,100]},{"label":"character","caption":"一位优雅的中国年轻女性，半身肖像，面容美丽，穿着轻薄透气的真丝连衣裙，带有灰粉色碎花图案。面料垂坠感极佳，凸显出她的身材曲线。","bbox":[-300,50,500,480]},{"label":"text","caption":"最大的主标题文字 'MOSS-Image'，采用粗体无衬线字体，奶油白色。","text":"MOSS-Image","bbox":[-400,-480,-300,-50]},{"label":"text","caption":"较小的副标题文字 'COMFYUI · SPATIAL LAYOUT'，采用复古黄铜金色。","text":"COMFYUI · SPATIAL LAYOUT","bbox":[-250,-480,-180,-50]},{"label":"text","caption":"精致的标语文字 '图片布局控制'，奶油白色。","text":"图片布局控制","bbox":[-150,-480,-100,-150]},{"label":"object","caption":"画面底部边缘的前景中，半透明的深青色植物叶子带有红色小花细节，稍微遮挡住人物，增加纵深感。","bbox":[300,-350,500,200]}],"bbox_format":"yxyx","bbox_coord_space":"abs_centralized"}

